# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. AI 助手 / 提示词 / 本地分析与草稿 (AI Prompts & Local Scratchpads)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 提示词目录与文件 (Prompts)
prompts/
prompt/
ai-prompts/
system_prompts/
*.prompt
*.prompts
*prompt*.md
*prompt*.txt
*prompt*.json
*prompt*.yaml
*prompt*.yml
prompt_*
*_prompt.*
*_prompts.*
prompt.*
prompts.*

# AI 助手指令、规则与入口文件 (AI Instructions & Rules)
GEMINI.md
gemini.md
CLAUDE.md
claude.md
CURSOR.md
cursor.md
WINDSURF.md
windsurf.md
COPILOT.md
copilot.md
CHATGPT.md
chatgpt.md
AGENTS.md
agents.md
*.agent.md
*.agents.md
.cursorrules

# AI 编程助手与工具本地配置 / 对话记录 / 任务追踪
.gemini/
.claude/
.cursor/
.windsurf/
.copilot/
.antigravity/
.aider*
.agents/
.harness/
chats/
chat_history/
